  "proofBoundary": "Direct retained-DXBC/RDEF role proof for the 4,086 reflectionProbeSampler fetches whose formula-A raw vector exactly matches TEXCOORD1.xyz + Nx*TEXCOORD3.xyz + Ny*TEXCOORD2.xyz and whose Nx/Ny value ancestry each reaches at least one normal-named reflected texture resource. Formula-B in all 4,086 is independently normalized ISGN TEXCOORD5.xyz. This promotes formula A to a normal-map-derived surface-normal path for this proven subset and rewrites the reflect equation accordingly. TEXCOORD5 remains viewCandidate: this stage does not yet prove its vertex-shader/camera-space provenance, and it does not assign surface-normal semantics to the remaining 1,802 reflection fetches.",
